#: ../../source/index.rst:9 724b53de9de34b3097749a4f1f988852
msgid "Godot-FmodPlayer 面向 Godot 4.7.2 或更新版本，基于 FMOD Core API 2.04 提供音频播放、混音、DSP 效果、3D 音频和性能监控功能。"
msgstr ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer targets Godot 4.7.2 or later and uses FMOD Core API 2.04 for audio playback, "
"mixing, DSP effects, 3D audio, and performance monitoring."

#: ../../source/index.rst:11 54df9d6cd15e4e9493e2de7f3e2969f8
msgid "适合用于需要比 Godot 原生音频系统更细致控制的项目，例如动态混音、实时音效处理、 长音频流式播放、空间音频和 FMOD 底层 API 集成。"
msgstr ""
"It is suitable for projects that need finer control than Godot's built-in audio system, such as "
"dynamic mixing, real-time audio processing, long streaming audio, spatial audio, and lower-level "
"FMOD API integration."

#: ../../source/index.rst:15 3e068dc218594cccb9addaf2369df2e3
msgid "主要功能"
msgstr "Key Features"

#: ../../source/index.rst:17 84ed98f728a14562aa9938257687c995
msgid "支持 MP3、WAV、OGG、FLAC、MOD、XM、S3M、IT、MIDI 等音频格式"
msgstr "Supports audio formats such as MP3, WAV, OGG, FLAC, MOD, XM, S3M, IT, and MIDI."

#: ../../source/index.rst:18 2e55173df83e4cce8f1c6854af1b8161
msgid "支持流式加载、样本加载、内存加载和 Godot PCK 资源加载"
msgstr "Supports streaming, sample loading, memory loading, and loading resources from Godot PCK files."

#: ../../source/index.rst:19 74c7ebbac0aa44129545cd2a17878a01
msgid "提供 ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer``、``FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D`` 和 ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D`` 播放节点"
msgstr ""
"Provides ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer``, ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D``, and ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D`` "
"playback nodes."

#: ../../source/index.rst:20 b9611bc1f6a74071a19683a7097396ee
msgid "支持通道、通道组、音频总线和实时混音控制"
msgstr "Supports channels, channel groups, audio buses, and real-time mixing control."

#: ../../source/index.rst:21 417de0e3db40476c815bb00cffd31e9e
msgid "提供混响、EQ、滤波、延迟、失真、压缩、频谱分析等 DSP 效果"
msgstr ""
"Provides DSP effects such as reverb, EQ, filtering, delay, distortion, compression, and spectrum "
"analysis."

#: ../../source/index.rst:22 045a914e68a14e6e9fe495790b4d339e
msgid "支持 FMOD CPU 与文件读取性能监控"
msgstr "Supports FMOD CPU and file I/O performance monitoring."

#: ../../source/index.rst:23 c7ed0203343143daacbb4ad6554f6ae5
msgid "提供编辑器导入器、音频预览和自定义资源类型"
msgstr "Provides an editor importer, audio preview, and custom resource types."

